WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:00.960
What's up guys!

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:01.980
We are Pongfinity.

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.180
Since you guys loved triangle
table tennis so much

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.140
We are back with a new table set up

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.740
One game to 11 points of Z-Pong

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.020
Let's go!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.900
I get to start.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.120
You still have no chance.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:14.880
0-0

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.480
I have too much power

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.660
No!

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:56.160
Run!

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:12.920
This is so tough!

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:19.680
I'm very sorry Otto.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.960
No! How can I miss that?

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:58.380
Roller!

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:13.380
Coming!

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:14.440
Nooo!

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:14.940
Close.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.340
Cheeky

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:23.980
Coming!

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.020
I've got a good serve coming up

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:26.700
Okay

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:29.760
It's coming up!

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.060
It was a good serve!

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.580
The ball just disappeared and suddenly
it's over there!

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:50.540
Sorry!

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.600
I'm not sorry!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:18.360
You fought well

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.980
But in the end it was obvious

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:20.720
Thanks.

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:24.040
Let us know in the comments if you have any cool table
set up ideas

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.000
And don't forget to hit subscribe!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:26.900
Until next time!

